1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,570
Five things you
must do in Iceland.

2
00:00:03,066 --> 00:00:04,675
Do soak in a local pool.

3
00:00:04,675 --> 00:00:07,022
UNESCO lists
this swimming culture,

4
00:00:07,022 --> 00:00:09,906
and everyone sits together
in the hot tubs.

5
00:00:10,409 --> 00:00:12,399
Do walk through Þingvellir.

6
00:00:12,399 --> 00:00:14,980
Iceland's parliament
first met here

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,749
in the year nine thirty.

8
00:00:17,244 --> 00:00:19,421
Do watch the geyser Strokkur.

9
00:00:19,421 --> 00:00:22,124
It erupts every
five to ten minutes.

10
00:00:22,629 --> 00:00:25,631
Do see the
icebergs at Jökulsárlón,

11
00:00:25,631 --> 00:00:28,289
then walk
Diamond Beach nearby.

12
00:00:28,787 --> 00:00:30,983
And do chase
the northern lights.

13
00:00:30,983 --> 00:00:33,312
The season runs
from late summer to

14
00:00:33,312 --> 00:00:33,977
mid April.
